mode: "100644"
text: "# The SWIPE framework — a Photo Mode carousel that earns completion\n\nPhoto Mode wins on **completion rate**, the primary signal TikTok applies to carousels — so every choice\nserves \"make them swipe to the end.\" SWIPE builds the carousel AND sets the WoopSocial PHOTO publish\nconfig. The agent writes the **plan + overlay copy + caption + config**; the **images are made by a human\nor an image skill**, and **WoopSocial publishes the native PHOTO post**.\n\n## S — Stop the scroll on slide 1\n- Slide 1 is the **thumbnail**: a bold visual or text-overlay **hook** (provocative question/claim) that\n  **promises a payoff** (\"the worst one is #5\"). It decides most of the reach.\n\n## W — Win the niche fit\n- Pick a **swipeable content type that fits the niche** (listicle / before-after / tutorial / hot take /\n  photo dump / story / myth-bust). **Honest:** photo mode is high-ceiling but **niche-dependent**,\n  outnumbered ~5:1 by video, with declining average performance — it must **earn its place**, not be forced.\n\n## I — Itemize for completion\n- **One idea per slide, progressive reveal, no repeats**, with **cliffhangers between slides.** **5–7\n  slides** (max 35). Design **9:16 1080×1920**, key content **centred** in the safe zone.\n\n## P — Pay off + prompt\n- **Reward on the final slide** (best insight/punchline); deliver any upfront promise; then **one clear\n  CTA** (save / comment / follow). Put a **question in the caption** (+comments); **don't beg for likes**.\n\n## E — Equip the publish config (WoopSocial PHOTO)\n- Set the TikTok PHOTO fields: **`postType=PHOTO`**, **`privacyLevel`** (from the account's platform-inputs),\n  **`allowComment`**, **`autoAddMusic`** (applies to PHOTO), and the disclosure flags **`isYourBrand` /\n  `isBrandedContent`** set **truthfully**. (`allowDuet`/`allowStitch` are required by the API but **ignored\n  for PHOTO**; there's **no `cover`** for photos.) Choose **`DIRECT_POST`** vs **`MEDIA_UPLOAD`** (inbox-to-\n  finish). Add **1–2 hashtags** + **text overlays** (TikTok SEO). **Validate before publish.** AI images →\n  WoopSocial auto-discloses on TikTok.\n\n## The carousel brief a request should fill\n```\nANGLE: swipeable content type + niche fit; the goal/KPI\nSLIDE 1: the hook (visual + overlay) + the payoff promise\nSLIDES 2-n: one idea each, progressive reveal, cliffhangers (5-7 slides, 9:16 1080x1920, centred)\nLAST SLIDE: reward/punchline + one CTA; caption question; 1-2 hashtags + overlay keywords\nPUBLISH (WoopSocial PHOTO): privacyLevel + allowComment + autoAddMusic + truthful isYourBrand/isBrandedContent + postMode; validate\nIMAGES + METRICS: images made by human/image skill (not WoopSocial); native analytics (never fabricated)\n```\n"
